WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.849
"Detective Smith!" Roxy scratched her head. "Where did he go?"

2
00:00:06.849 --> 00:00:09.960
One of the guards pointed toward the bus.

3
00:00:09.960 --> 00:00:15.166
Roxy flew over. She found the detective hiding behind the bus.

4
00:00:15.166 --> 00:00:21.071
Roxy frowned. "What are you doing? We have to catch Mr. Bubbles!"

5
00:00:21.071 --> 00:00:23.412
Detective Smith bit his lip.

6
00:00:23.412 --> 00:00:28.196
"Don't tell anyone. But I'm afraid of clowns."

7
00:00:28.196 --> 00:00:31.317
Roxy was shocked. "Really?"

8
00:00:31.317 --> 00:00:33.841
"Yes!" Detective Smith said.

9
00:00:33.841 --> 00:00:37.689
"So can you catch Mr. Bubbles on your own?"

10
00:00:37.689 --> 00:00:39.845
Roxy put her hands on her hips.

11
00:00:39.845 --> 00:00:43.064
"I won't tell anyone you're afraid of clowns, Detective.

12
00:00:43.064 --> 00:00:46.442
But you should really face your fear."

13
00:00:46.442 --> 00:00:51.118
Detective Smith sighed. "You're right. You go ahead.

14
00:00:51.118 --> 00:00:54.667
I'll follow in my patrol car and meet you downtown."

15
00:00:54.667 --> 00:00:59.796
"Okay, Detective," Roxy said. "But you'd better be there!"

16
00:00:59.796 --> 00:01:03.660
Roxy flew off.

17
00:01:03.660 --> 00:01:08.631
She soon spotted a tiny clown car speeding through downtown Metro City.

18
00:01:08.631 --> 00:01:11.698
Two police cars chased it.

19
00:01:11.698 --> 00:01:14.593
A clown leaned out of the tiny car's window.

20
00:01:14.593 --> 00:01:16.806
His hair was bright green.

21
00:01:16.806 --> 00:01:20.012
"I'm never going back to that filthy prison!

22
00:01:20.012 --> 00:01:23.707
Do you hear me? Never!"

23
00:01:23.707 --> 00:01:28.038
Roxy fired her eye laser beams. Whiz-hoo!

24
00:01:28.038 --> 00:01:31.460
One of the tiny car's tires popped.

25
00:01:31.461 --> 00:01:34.615
The car skidded to a stop.

26
00:01:34.615 --> 00:01:38.085
The clown with green hair stepped out.

27
00:01:38.085 --> 00:01:41.196
A flower was pinned to his jacket.

28
00:01:41.196 --> 00:01:43.272
Another clown got out of the car.

29
00:01:43.272 --> 00:01:47.301
Then two more clowns got out too.

30
00:01:47.301 --> 00:01:51.469
"How did they all fit in that tiny car?" Roxy thought.

31
00:01:51.469 --> 00:01:55.944
The clown with green hair glared at Roxy. "Rocket Girl!"

32
00:01:55.944 --> 00:01:59.947
"I'm taking you back to prison, Mr. Bubbles!" Roxy shouted.

33
00:01:59.947 --> 00:02:03.480
"And everyone in your gang will be joining you!"

34
00:02:03.480 --> 00:02:08.331
Mr. Bubbles chuckled. "What do you think, boys?

35
00:02:08.331 --> 00:02:13.006
Should we let this little girl take us to prison?"

36
00:02:13.006 --> 00:02:15.047
The other clowns laughed.

37
00:02:15.047 --> 00:02:17.111
"No way, boss!"

38
00:02:17.111 --> 00:02:19.438
"Prison sounds terrible!"

39
00:02:19.438 --> 00:02:21.490
Mr. Bubbles stared at Roxy.

40
00:02:21.491 --> 00:02:25.258
"You heard the clowns. We're not going!"

41
00:02:25.258 --> 00:02:28.575
He pulled a bottle from his pocket and pressed a button.

42
00:02:28.576 --> 00:02:30.767
Liquid sprayed out.

43
00:02:30.767 --> 00:02:34.053
Roxy jumped up, and the liquid hit a mailbox.

44
00:02:34.053 --> 00:02:36.755
The mailbox melted into a puddle.

45
00:02:36.755 --> 00:02:41.804
"Yikes!" Roxy gulped. "This clown really is evil!"

46
00:02:41.804 --> 00:02:46.597
"Ha-ha-ha!" Mr. Bubbles let out an evil laugh and pressed the button again.

47
00:02:46.597 --> 00:02:49.105
But no more liquid came out.

48
00:02:49.105 --> 00:02:55.578
"Ugh! It's empty!" Mr. Bubbles threw the bottle at the ground.

49
00:02:55.578 --> 00:02:59.689
"Don't worry, boss!" Another clown ran back to the tiny car.

50
00:02:59.689 --> 00:03:06.152
"This will take care of Rocket Girl!" He popped open the trunk.

51
00:03:06.152 --> 00:03:10.470
Roxy heard a rumble and some loud squeaks.

52
00:03:10.470 --> 00:03:19.006
Roxy gasped. Big balloon animals leaped from the trunk!

